      "message": "...any more\n\n(if this is called then the diagnostics completed successfully, which I take to mean that necessarily the network used to be active. Is that accurate ? Or are there, say, combinations of parameters what will result in this being called even if the network was already disconnected before the diagnostics will requested ?)",
