      },
      "lineNbr": 101,
      "author": {
        "id": 1463964
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-12-14T06:43:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the network disconnected before diagnostics were requested, this callback will not fire.\nIf the network disconnects while the diagnostics are being collected (before the last socket is bound), this callback will not fire.\n\nThis means that the network must have been active when the request was made.",
      "parentUuid": "00f8d37c_6a225b04",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 101,
        "startChar": 47,
        "endLine": 101,
        "endChar": 53
